00:09:37.760 --> 00:09:38.920
Clint, did you see it?

00:09:38.920 --> 00:09:43.760
C: Yeah, so if the actor has his legs, which I assume he does,

00:09:43.760 --> 00:09:48.180
then how does he swipe his legs past the coffee table?
W: Yeah, exactly!

00:09:48.180 --> 00:09:50.520
So here's what I think they did.

00:09:50.520 --> 00:09:53.680
That table wasn't there when they filmed Gary's knees -

00:09:53.680 --> 00:09:55.440
- and they added that table back in.

00:09:55.440 --> 00:09:57.680
