*Clint freakout*

00:11:39.020 --> 00:11:41.740
C: They're not filming in black and white! They're not!

00:11:41.940 --> 00:11:44.540
It's not in black and white! They're color correcting it

00:11:44.540 --> 00:11:48.079
So it is in black and white and then they reveal it so that it looks like it

00:11:48.990 --> 00:11:53.539
N: But that doesn't make sense Clint. 
C: What of course it makes sense! You just mask it and just track your mask

00:11:53.540 --> 00:11:56.240
W: I mean, I agree with Clint on this that makes sense to me

00:11:56.310 --> 00:12:02.359
you just do a luma key on anything that's like brights in the shot and then specifically mask out the

00:12:02.480 --> 00:12:06.440
Spots that you need that are gonna be yellow, 
N: But I guess that fire truck can't be red, -

00:12:06.440 --> 00:12:12.180
- that flag can't be red white and blue that house has to be painted white already because if you're going to let the colour through -

